# Scoped to the oba CLI module. Entries already covered by the root .gitignore
# (dist/, .idea/, .vscode/, *.swp, *.out, .DS_Store) are not repeated here.
#
# The leading slashes keep each pattern to this directory: an unanchored
# pattern matches at any depth, and a bare "bin/" or "oba" would ignore
# unrelated paths elsewhere in the monorepo.
/bin/
/oba
